sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Stack
    participant FileSystem
    
    User->>Stack: pushd /dir1
    Stack->>FileSystem: Change to /dir1
    User->>Stack: pushd /dir2
    Stack->>FileSystem: Change to /dir2
    User->>Stack: dirs -v
    Stack->>User: Show stack
    User->>Stack: popd
    Stack->>FileSystem: Return to /dir1